## Tiers

Per `01-PRODUCT-VISION.md` §1.6:

| Tier | Price (USD, indicative) | Term | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Free | $0 | perpetual | Discovery experience with capability limits |
| Pro Yearly | $24 / year | 1 year, auto-renew optional | All Pro features, 3 devices |
| Pro Lifetime | $79 one-time | perpetual, current major version + 1 year of updates | All Pro features for current major version + 1 year of updates; minor updates free forever; major version upgrades optional paid |

